{"seq":4,"slug":"spacing-and-layout-tokens","title":"间距与布局令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/spacing-and-layout-tokens","wordCount":1683,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"间距与布局令牌\">间距与布局令牌</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>间距令牌（Spacing Token）定义设计系统中所有内边距（padding）、外边距（margin）、间隙（gap）、圆角（border-radius）等空间相关数值——一致的间距让界面呈现韵律感和整体协调性。基于 4 像素或 8 像素网格（最小单位），2 的幂次加上中间值（4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64）是行业标准的间距阶梯。T 恤尺码命名（xs / sm / md / lg / xl）让设计师和工程师拥有共同词汇。布局令牌（最大宽度、断点、容器宽度）解决响应式设计问题。圆角、阴影和 z-index 也是与布局相关的令牌。本节详细讲解间距阶梯设计、网格系统、布局令牌、阴影/圆角/z-index，以及无障碍考量（触控目标尺寸）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>所属层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>间距</td>\n<td>spacing.4 / spacing.md</td>\n<td>引用层 + 系统层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸</td>\n<td>size.icon-sm / button-md</td>\n<td>组件层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圆角</td>\n<td>radius.sm / md / lg / pill</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴影</td>\n<td>shadow.sm / md / lg / xl</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z轴层级</td>\n<td>z.dropdown / modal / tooltip</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点</td>\n<td>breakpoint.sm / md / lg / xl</td>\n<td>引用层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>间距令牌从网格基准派生，并按数字命名与语义命名两套体系对外暴露：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;网格基准 4px / 8px&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;间距阶梯 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 / 64&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;引用层命名 spacing.4&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;系统层命名 spacing.md&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;组件令牌 size.button / size.icon&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[\"网格基准 4px / 8px\"] --&gt; B[\"间距阶梯 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 / 64\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"引用层命名 spacing.4\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"系统层命名 spacing.md\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"组件令牌 size.button / size.icon\"]\n  D --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"间距阶梯\">间距阶梯</h2><p><strong>4 像素网格</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最小单位 4px。</li>\n<li>所有间距是 4 的倍数。</li>\n<li>4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64, 80, 96, 128。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>8 像素网格</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最小单位 8px。</li>\n<li>4, 8, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96, 128。</li>\n<li>Material Design 采用此方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>4 像素更精细。</li>\n<li>8 像素规则更简单。</li>\n<li>实际项目：4 像素是主流选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"令牌命名\">令牌命名</h2><p><strong>数字命名</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>spacing.4 = 4px</code>。</li>\n<li><code>spacing.8 = 8px</code>。</li>\n<li>与数值关联清晰直观。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>T 恤尺码命名</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>spacing.xs = 4px</code>。</li>\n<li><code>spacing.sm = 8px</code>。</li>\n<li><code>spacing.md = 16px</code>。</li>\n<li><code>spacing.lg = 24px</code>。</li>\n<li><code>spacing.xl = 32px</code>。</li>\n<li>易于记忆。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>引用层使用数字命名（<code>spacing.4</code>）。</li>\n<li>系统层使用语义命名（<code>spacing.md</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"完整间距阶梯\">完整间距阶梯</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;spacing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;0&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;0px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;1&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;4px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;2&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;8px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;3&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;12px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;4&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;16px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;5&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;20px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;6&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;24px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;8&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;32px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;10&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;40px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;12&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;48px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;16&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;64px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;20&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;80px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;24&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;96px&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"12px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"32px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"10\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"40px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"12\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"48px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"64px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"80px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"96px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或使用 T 恤尺码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;spacing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;none&quot;: &quot;0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;xxs&quot;: &quot;4px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;xs&quot;: &quot;8px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;12px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;md&quot;: &quot;16px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;24px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;xl&quot;: &quot;32px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;2xl&quot;: &quot;48px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;3xl&quot;: &quot;64px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;4xl&quot;: &quot;96px&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xxs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"12px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"32px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"2xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"48px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"3xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"64px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"4xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"96px\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"间距应用场景\">间距应用场景</h2><p><strong>内边距（Padding）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>元素内部间距。</li>\n<li>卡片内容区边距。</li>\n<li>按钮内边距。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>外边距（Margin）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>元素之间的间距。</li>\n<li>区块间的分隔。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>间隙（Gap）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网格或弹性布局子元素间距。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>8 点网格布局</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有间距为 8 的倍数。</li>\n<li>视觉呈现整体协调。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组件尺寸\">组件尺寸</h2><p><strong>组件特定尺寸</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;size&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;button&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;height-sm&quot;: &quot;32px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;height-md&quot;: &quot;40px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;height-lg&quot;: &quot;48px&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;icon&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;16px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;md&quot;: &quot;20px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;24px&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;avatar&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;24px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;md&quot;: &quot;40px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;64px&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"height-sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"32px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"height-md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"40px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shi