\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dropdown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sticky\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fixed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1200\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"modalBackdrop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1300\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"modal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1400\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"popover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tooltip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1600\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>为何需要</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免随意使用 <code>z-index: 9999999</code>。</li>\n<li>确保层级堆叠可预测。</li>\n<li>便于统一更新调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"断点\">断点</h2><p><strong>令牌定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;breakpoint&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;xs&quot;: &quot;0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;640px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;md&quot;: &quot;768px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;1024px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;xl&quot;: &quot;1280px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;2xl&quot;: &quot;1536px&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"breakpoint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"640px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"768px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1024px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1280px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"2xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1536px\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>响应式设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移动端优先。</li>\n<li>使用最小宽度断点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>组件行为</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>小于 md：垂直堆叠。</li>\n<li>大于等于 md：水平并排。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"容器\">容器</h2><p><strong>令牌定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;container&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;640px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;md&quot;: &quot;768px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;1024px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;xl&quot;: &quot;1280px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;2xl&quot;: &quot;1536px&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"container\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"640px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"768px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1024px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1280px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"2xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1536px\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用途</strong>：居中容器的最大宽度约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应式间距\">响应式间距</h2><p><strong>移动端使用较小间距</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;spacing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;section&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;32px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;md&quot;: &quot;64px&quot;,&#10;      &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;96px&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"section\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"32px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"64px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"96px\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>或使用流体间距</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>clamp(32px, 5vw, 96px)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"material-8-点网格\">Material 8 点网格</h2><p><strong>Material Design 8 点网格</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有间距为 8 的倍数。</li>\n<li>视觉呈现整体协调。</li>\n<li>例外：图标内边距可用 4dp。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>设计原理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在常见 DPI 上实现像素对齐。</li>\n<li>简化心智模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tailwind-间距\">Tailwind 间距</h2><p><strong>Tailwind 默认</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 = 4px</code>、<code>2 = 8px</code>、<code>4 = 16px</code>、<code>6 = 24px</code>、<code>8 = 32px</code>...</li>\n<li>基于类名：<code>p-4</code>、<code>gap-6</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自定义配置</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 <code>tailwind.config.js</code> 中扩展设计系统令牌。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"设计令牌与布局\">设计令牌与布局</h2><p><strong>容器查询</strong>（现代 CSS 特性）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于父元素尺寸而非视口尺寸。</li>\n<li>实现更精细的组件级响应式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>令牌集成</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@container (min-width: 400px) {&#10;  .card {&#10;    padding: var(--spacing-lg);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (min-width: 400px) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--spacing-lg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>浏览器支持</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2024 年起主流浏览器均已支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 随意间距</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 5px、7px、13px 等非规范值。</li>\n<li>视觉缺乏整体协调性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 令牌过多</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定义了 20 个间距令牌。</li>\n<li>简化到约 10 个即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 缺乏系统性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>未遵循网格规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 像素僵化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不支持响应式。</li>\n<li>应使用 rem 或响应式令牌。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 未建立 z-index 体系</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用任意数值 → 层级冲突。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 阴影滥用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个元素都加阴影 → 视觉噪音。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>7. 触控目标过小</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移动端按钮小于 44px。</li>\n<li>导致无障碍测试失败。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战案例\">实战案例</h2><p><strong>Material 8 点网格</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有值为 8 的倍数。</li>\n<li>图标内边距例外使用 4dp。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tailwind 默认</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>4px 基准。</li>\n<li>内置间距阶梯。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Carbon</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>8 个间距令牌。</li>\n<li>保持简洁。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Atlassian</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 T 恤尺码命名。</li>\n<li>多层架构设计。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>间距令牌系统化管理空间相关数值——基于 4 像素或 8 像素网格（最小单位），2 的幂次加上中间值（4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64）是行业标准。命名策略为引用层使用数字（<code>spacing.4 = 4px</code>）加系统层使用语义（<code>spacing.md = 16px</code>），T 恤尺码（xs/sm/md/lg/xl）便于记忆。完整阶梯为 11 级，从 0 到 96px。应用于内边距（元素内部）、外边距（元素之间）和间隙（网格弹性布局），8 点网格让视觉呈现整体协调。组件尺寸包括按钮/图标/头像的尺寸令牌，触控目标要求 Apple 44×44 / Material 48×48 / WCAG 24×24 最小值。圆角令牌有 none/sm/md/lg/xl/2xl/full，小号用于行内元素、大号用于卡片、完整圆角用于胶囊形。阴影采用 Material 层级高度系统 0-24 dp，卡片用 sm-md、弹窗用 lg-xl、工具提示用 md，暗色模式下阴影不可见，改用提升背景色。Z轴层级令牌包括 base/dropdown/sticky/fixed/modal/popover/tooltip，替代任意的 9999 数值。断点为 sm 640 / md 768 / lg 1024 / xl 1280 / 2xl 1536，采用移动端优先的最小宽度策略。容器最大宽度用于居中布局。响应式间距在移动端使用较小值，或使用流体 clamp 函数。Material 8 点网格、Tailwind 4px 基准、Carbon 8 个令牌、Atlassian T 恤尺码是各具特色的案例。容器查询是现代 CSS 的组件级响应式方案，可与令牌集成。应避免的反模式包括：随意间距、令牌过多、缺乏系统性、像素僵化、未建立 z-index 体系、阴影滥用和触控目标过小。布局令牌是界面韵律的根基——做好了能让设计视觉协调、响应式友好且无障碍达标。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"间距与布局令牌","id":"间距与布局令牌"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"间距阶梯","id":"间距阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌命名","id":"令牌命名"},{"level":2,"text":"完整间距阶梯","id":"完整间距阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"间距应用场景","id":"间距应用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"组件尺寸","id":"组件尺寸"},{"level":2,"text":"圆角","id":"圆角"},{"level":2,"text":"阴影","id":"阴影"},{"level":2,"text":"Z轴层级","id":"z轴层级"},{"level":2,"text":"断点","id":"断点"},{"level":2,"text":"容器","id":"容器"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式间距","id":"响应式间距"},{"level":2,"text":"Material 8 点网格","id":"material-8-点网格"},{"level":2,"text":"Tailwind 间距","id":"tailwind-间距"},{"level":2,"text":"设计令牌与布局","id":"设计令牌与布局"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战案例","id":"实战案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"排版令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/typography-tokens"},"next":{"title":"Style Dictionary 构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/style-dictionary"}}